Project Name: CrustCraft

Category: Full Stack Web Development

Description:
CrustCraft is a full-stack pizza delivery platform that allows
customers to browse pizzas, customize their own pizzas, place
orders, make test payments, and track orders in real time.

Technology Stack:
Frontend: React, Vite, CSS
Backend: Node.js, Express.js
Database: MongoDB
Authentication: JWT
Payments: Razorpay Test Mode
Real-time: Socket.IO

